### Get channels

GET http://localhost:5003/api/channels HTTP/1.1


### Create channel

POST http://localhost:5003/api/channels HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channelId": "sample-1",
  "lastWatchedAt": "2026-04-01",
  "subscriberCount": 100000,
  "thumbnailUrl": "",
  "title": "Sample Tech Channel"
}


### Delete Channel

DELETE http://localhost:5003/api/channels/6a0b03ed8573c57277d8f24e HTTP/1.1
